---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Custom Built Services | Elmech Engineering" description="Tailor-made gearbox solutions for your unique engineering challenges.">
  <section class="relative py-24 border-b border-slate-200 overflow-hidden bg-slate-900">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1504307651254-35680f356dfd?q=80&w=2000&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Custom Engineering Fabrication" class="w-full h-full object-cover filter brightness-90 contrast-105" />
    </div>
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-slate-900/40 backdrop-blur-[1px] z-0"></div>
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-900/50 via-slate-900/30 to-slate-900/60 z-0"></div>
    
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 relative z-10 text-center">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white/15 border border-white/25 text-blue-300 font-bold px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full mb-4 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider backdrop-blur-md shadow-sm">
          Bespoke Heavy Engineering
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-black text-white mb-4 tracking-tight drop-shadow-lg">Custom Built <span class="text-blue-400">Solutions</span></h1>
        <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-slate-200 font-medium max-w-2xl mx-auto drop-shadow-md">
          Tailor-made gearboxes and power transmission systems engineered specifically for your unique operational requirements.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 bg-slate-50 min-h-screen">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-5xl">
      <div class="bg-white p-8 md:p-12 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-6 tracking-tight">Tailor-Made Industrial Reduction Gears</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-700 font-medium leading-relaxed mb-6">
          At <strong>Elmech Engineering Company</strong>, we specialize in the design, development, and manufacturing of custom reduction gearboxes built around your unique machine footprint, ratio requirements, and extreme duty cycles.
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-700 font-medium leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Whether you require non-standard center distances, special shaft extensions, heavy thrust absorption packages for twin-screw extruders, or multi-speed configurations, our in-house design and precision hobbing facility delivers exact-tolerance solutions.
        </p>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mt-8">
          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Mechanical Customizations</h3>
            <ul class="text-slate-600 text-sm space-y-2">
              <li>&bull; Non-standard center distances (up to 304.8 mm and above)</li>
              <li>&bull; Special input/output shaft extensions, keyways & splines</li>
              <li>&bull; Custom mounting flanges & universal multi-mount adaptability</li>
              <li>&bull; Water cooling coils & forced spray lubrication circuits</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Electrical & Duty Options</h3>
            <ul class="text-slate-600 text-sm space-y-2">
              <li>&bull; Special voltage / frequency options (160V to 600V, 60Hz)</li>
              <li>&bull; Brake motors, crane duty & flameproof enclosures (IS:4691)</li>
              <li>&bull; Multi-speed pole switching & DC motor compatibility</li>
              <li>&bull; Class H insulation & PTC thermistor thermal protection</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="text-center bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-3xl p-8 md:p-10">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Have a Custom Project Requirement?</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600 font-medium mb-6 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Send us your torque, RPM, and shaft drawings for a detailed technical proposal from our engineering team.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="inline-block bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-bold px-8 py-3.5 rounded-xl shadow-md transition-all hover:scale-105">Request Custom Engineering Quote</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
